This product includes clean-room Position Based Fluids (PBF), viscoelastic, and granular physics implementations developed from scratch for Minecraft 1.21.1 and 1.21.11 (Fabric & NeoForge).

Gameplay concept inspired by Realistic Water by Skaffy (https://github.com/sskaffy/Realistic-Water).
No source code, shaders, or assets from the original mod are included in this project.
